hines or remote service units; (9) checks drawn against insufficient funds that the bank assesses regardless of whether it decides to pay, return or hold the check; (10) issuing stop payment orders; (11) certifying checks; and (12) accumulating or disbursing funds deposited in IRAs or Keogh Plan accounts when not handled by the bank's trust department. This item does not include penalties assessed on the early withdrawal of time deposits.","units":{"USD":[{"start":"2017-01-01","end":"2017-03-31","val":419735,"accn":"0001564590-18-013625","fy":2018,"fp":"Q1","form":"10-Q","filed":"2018-05-15","frame":"CY2017Q1"},{"start":"2018-01-01","end":"2018-03-31","val":537445,"accn":"0001564590-18-013625","fy":2018,"fp":"Q1","form":"10-Q","filed":"2018-05-15","frame":"CY2018Q1"}]}},"FinancingReceivableAccruedInterestAfterAllowanceForCreditLoss":{"label":"Financing Receivable, Accrued Interest, after Allowance for Credit Loss","description":"Amount, after allowance for credit loss, of accrued interest on financing receivable.","units":{"USD":[{"end":"2020-12-31","val":643000,"accn":"0001564590-21-013169","fy":2020,"fp":"FY","form":"10-K","filed":"2021-03-15"},{"end":"2020-12-31","val":4400000,"accn":"0001628280-22-006724","fy":2021,"fp":"FY","form":"10-K","filed":"2022-03-18","frame":"CY2020Q4I"},{"end":"2021-03-31","val":636000,"accn":"0001564590-21-025335","fy":2021,"fp":"Q1","form":"10-Q","filed":"2021-05-07","frame":"CY2021Q1I"},{"end":"2021-12-31","val":4400000,"accn":"0001628280-22-006724","fy":2021,"fp":"FY","form":"10-K","filed":"2022-03-18"},{"end":"2021-12-31","val":4400000,"accn":"0001628280-22-014343","fy":2022,"fp":"Q1","form":"10-Q","filed":"2022-05-13"},{"end":"2021-12-31","val":4400000,"accn":"0001628280-22-022616","fy":2022,"fp":"Q2","form":"10-Q","filed":"2022-08-12"},{"end":"2021-12-31","val":4400000,"accn":"0001628280-22-029750","fy":2022,"fp":"Q3","form":"10-Q","filed":"2022-11-14"},{"end":"2021-12-31","val":4400000,"accn":"0001628280-23-008245","fy":2022,"f